Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Number six: catching
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.89,0:00:03.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,a twenty-ton boulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:04.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,Mountain roads hang
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:05.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,steel nets on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.61,0:00:06.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,the slopes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:06.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,above them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.15,0:00:07.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,The net is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.76,0:00:08.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,woven from steel
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.81,0:00:09.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,rings, like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,chain mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.73,0:00:11.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,When a rock
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:12.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,hits, the net
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.65,0:00:13.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,doesn't try to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.29,0:00:14.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop it dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.66,0:00:15.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,It stretches like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:17.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,a trampoline, more
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:18.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,than twenty feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:19.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,And the ropes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:19.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,that hold it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:20.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,pull through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,brake rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.81,0:00:22.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,These steel loops
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:23.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,shrink and bend,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:25.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,turning the speed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:25.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,into heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:27.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,A slow stop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:28.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,keeps the forces
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.11,0:00:28.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,low, so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:30.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,nothing snaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.51,0:00:31.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,The biggest nets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:32.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,stop twenty tons
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:33.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,at sixty miles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:34.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.56,0:00:36.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Afterward, crews clear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:37.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,the rock and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.03,0:00:38.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,replace the brakes.
